  "definitions": "<defs xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><marker id=\"arrow\" markerUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L9,4 L0,8 Z\" fill=\"#263348\" /></marker></defs>\n",
  "extras": "<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"600.0\" y=\"37\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"600.0\" dy=\"0\">ZeroConv2d conditioner  |  Module decomposition</tspan>\n</text>\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#344155\">\n<tspan x=\"600.0\" dy=\"0\">static module / explicit profile  /  read bottom to top</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"55.0\" y=\"1078\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f8d4e1\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"78.0\" y=\"1091\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"78.0\" dy=\"0\">Inputs</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"1078\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#ffddb3\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"263.0\" y=\"1091\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"263.0\" dy=\"0\">Module</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"425.0\" y=\"1078\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#c8ebfb\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"448.0\" y=\"1091\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"448.0\" dy=\"0\">Convolution</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"610.0\" y=\"1078\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff6bd\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"633.0\" y=\"1091\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"633.0\" dy=\"0\">Norm / math</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"795.0\" y=\"1078\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#cdeaf8\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"818.0\" y=\"1091\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"818.0\" dy=\"0\">Reshape</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"980.0\" y=\"1078\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#dfdff8\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"1003.0\" y=\"1091\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"1003.0\" dy=\"0\">Outputs</tspan>\n</text>\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"600.0\" y=\"1119\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#344155\">\n<tspan x=\"600.0\" dy=\"0\">Bottom-to-top; independent outputs are parallel, never an implicit tensor chain</tspan>\n<tspan x=\"600.0\" dy=\"16.52\">Colors denote roles; Parameter / buffer / ordinary state are recorded separately in IR</tspan>\n<tspan x=\"600.0\" dy=\"16.52\">Fixed source symbols + explicit profile; library operators are call boundaries</tspan>\n</text>\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"600.0\" y=\"1223\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#344155\">\n<tspan x=\"600.0\" dy=\"0\">Reviewed static source + selected profile. Repeated groups are templates; shapes are not runtime observations.</tspan>\n</text>\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"600.0\" y=\"1253\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#344155\">\n<tspan x=\"600.0\" dy=\"0\">E### = source span; dashed = side / shape dependencies; fork/join roles are typed in IR; no implicit sum.</tspan>\n</text>\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"600.0\" y=\"1278\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#344155\">\n<tspan x=\"600.0\" dy=\"0\">Repeated colors encode operation roles. Shared weights and independent instances are recorded in semantic_ir.json.</tspan>\n</text>\n",
